,"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"The heavy–light decomposition of a rooted tree or arborescence: each vertex’s heavy child is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its child with the largest subtree (the first in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"children(of:)"},{"type":"text","text":" order on a tie), and the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"heavy edges form paths. Vertices get positions in a preorder that takes the heavy child first,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"so each heavy path and each subtree is an interval of positions, and any path between two"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"vertices is at most 2⌊log₂ n⌋ + 1 intervals ("},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"segments(from:to:)"},{"type":"text","text":"), for path and subtree"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"queries over a structure indexed by position."}],"url":"\/documentation\/treealgorithms\/heavylightdecomposition"},"doc://TreeAlgorithms/documentation/TreeAlgorithms/HeavyLightDecomposition/Preorder-swift.struct/scan(_:)":{"title":"scan(_:)","kind":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/TreeAlgorithms\/documentation\/TreeAlgorithms\/HeavyLightDecomposition\/Preorder-swift.struct\/scan(_:)","deprecated":true,"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"scan"},{"kind":"text","text":"(("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":", "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"},{"kind":"text","text":" -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Self"},{"kind":"text","text":"."},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","text":"Element","preciseIdentifier":"s:ST7ElementQa"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind"